  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色思辨-如果我有一片森林",
    "sub_ename": "GREEN DEBATES - IF I HAVE A FOREST",
    "describe_ch": "這門課將帶你從台灣林業的歷史故事出發，走進傳統森林經營到現今多目標經營的多元議題。課程更強調批判性思維與跨領域合作：同學必須參與討論、辯論與小組專題，從經濟、環境、社會多角度來看森林的價值。無論你是商管、理工、人文或設計背景，都能在課堂中找到自己的切入點，練習如何用永續思維解決真實世界的問題。這不只是一堂林業課，更是一場關於未來、關於我們與地球的探索之旅。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will take you on a journey starting from the historical stories of Taiwan's forestry, leading you into the diverse issues from traditional forest management to today's multi-objective management. The course particularly emphasizes critical thinking and interdisciplinary collaboration: students must participate in discussions, debates, and group projects, examining the value of forests from economic, environmental, and social perspectives. Whether your background is in business administration, science and engineering, humanities, or design, you will find your own entry point in the classroom and practice how to solve real-world problems with sustainable thinking. This is not just a forestry course, but an exploratory journey about the future and our relationship with the Earth.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
